%% DM26-0670

%% A proposal to observe a repository, as built (2026-11-04, docs/architecture/proposals.md, git-controller.md). The one proposer today is the discover_repo harness
%% (git/observe/src/bin/discover_repo.rs): nothing in a deployed agent proposes yet. What an accepted repository leads to is general/git_repository_observation.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant Proposer as A proposer<br/>(the discover_repo harness)
    participant Cassini
    participant Controller as git-repo-controller
    participant Proc as git-repo-processor
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Observer as git-repo-observer

    Note over Admin,Controller: The admission rules first: a signed runtime section, by the usual delivery
    Admin-)Controller: signed section admission, verified for itself. Until then every proposal is pending

    Proposer-)Cassini: Proposal { url, evidence } on polar-proposal-observe-repo
    Cassini-)Controller: the Proposal, published_by stamped by the broker. Its only subscriber
    Controller->>Controller: receive, into a bounded table, kept in memory only
    alt no proposer stamped, a URL not canonical, a proposer not in the rules, or the table is full
        Controller-)Cassini: ProposalDecision rejected, at once
    else held, and judged on a copy, off the actor
        Controller->>Controller: kind, rules, proposer, url, denied, host, organisation
        Controller->>Controller: the network guard: unresolved stays pending, not public is rejected
        Controller->>Controller: limits, then approval and credential, either of which stays pending
        Controller-)Cassini: ProposalDecision on polar.git.proposals.decisions, only when it changed:<br/>accepted, rejected, pending or expired
    end
    Cassini-)Proc: ProposalDecision
    Proc->>Graph: a GitProposal, for one held, and PROPOSES if accepted
    opt accepted
        Controller-)Observer: the whole RepositorySet, with this repository in it
    end

    Note over Admin,Controller: An approval is a signed edit
    Admin-)Controller: a new version of admission
    Controller->>Controller: judge every held proposal again

    loop every 60 s
        Controller->>Controller: expire a claim past its time (1 day by default), publish expired,<br/>judge again and announce what changed
    end

    Note over Proposer,Controller: A restarted controller starts with an empty table. Proposals are not replayed: the proposers are to announce again, and the harness does not, so what<br/>it proposed leaves the set after the warm-up. Only the signed sections come back, by replay on registration (configuration_replay)
